"tags":["coding","python","tests"],"status":"completed","created_at":"2026-08-31T21:34:26.330Z","body":"Updated `/workspace/in/schema_migration/client.py` to convert legacy v1/v1.1/v1.2 and v2 payloads, preserve unknown fields with PII filtering, add aggregated `convert_many`, audit output, and CLI support. Verified with `py_compile` and manual conversion checks. `pytest` could not run here because the environment does not have `pytest` installed."}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788212233721},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Updated `client.py` at:\n\n- `/workspace/in/schema_migration/client.py`\n\nWhat changed:\n- Added legacy `v1`, `v1.1`, `v1.2`, and v2 support\n- Mapped:\n  - `id` / `order_ref` → `orderId`\n  - `customer_*` / nested `customer.*` → `buyer.*`\n  - `items` / `lines` → `lineItems`\n  - `qty` → `quantity`\n  - `price_cents` / `unit_price_cents` → `unitPriceCents`\n  - shipping postal variants → `shipping.address.postalCode`\n- Defaulted blank/null shipping method to `\"standard\"`\n- Preserved unknown non-PII fields in `metadata.unknownFields`\n- Dropped obvious PII-like fields\n- Kept v2 payloads idempotent\n- Added `convert_many(payloads)` with aggregated `errors` and `warnings`\n- Wrote `conversion_audit.json` on `convert_many(...)`\n- Added CLI: `python -m client input.jsonl output.json`\n\nChecks I ran:\n- `python3 -m py_compile client.py`\n- manual conversion checks on sample payloads\n\nI could not run:\n- `python -m pytest ...`\n\nReason:\n- this environment has no `python` binary and no installed `pytest` for `python3`.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_002ac5f35a660012016a95f40befb487d2a0765b192599e5b0\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":616,"output":294,"cacheRead":26624,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":27534,"cost":{"input":0.0015400000000000001,"output":0.00441,"cacheRead":0.006656,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.012606}